Z||000000||Formula||09-17-2001||04:06 PM||||Dont look at other peoples answers...<P>1. Name the 6 U.S. presidents who arent buried in the continental USA<P>2. If you have a match to light a oil lantern, wood stove, and kerosene heater, what one would you light first?<P>3.if a doctor gives you 3 pills to take every half hour, how long will they last?<P>4. if a man is living in Pittsburgh PA, why cant he be buried west of the mississippi?<P>5. if there are 3 apples and you take 2, how many do you have?<P>6. if 2 men playing chess play 5 games and each man wins the same amount of games, and there are no ties, draws, and every game is completed, how did they do it?<P>7. if a truck driver stops to help a woman on the road who has a flat tire, and after helping the woman she offers $10, the truck driver refuses to take $10 from a sister, and the truckdriver is not the womans brother, what happened?<P>8. if 40 people are on a bus, and it costs $.25 per person to ride the bus, how much money did they pay?<P>9. several months have 30 and 31 days, but how many have 28?<P>10. if a man leaves home and makes 3 left turns, who are the 2 people in black masks at the end?||||reg||1
