Z||000015||Formula88||09-17-2001||10:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Formula:<BR><B>Dont look at other peoples answers...<P>1. Name the 6 U.S. presidents who arent buried in the continental USA<P>2. If you have a match to light a oil lantern, wood stove, and kerosene heater, what one would you light first?<P>3.if a doctor gives you 3 pills to take every half hour, how long will they last?<P>4. if a man is living in Pittsburgh PA, why cant he be buried west of the mississippi?<P>5. if there are 3 apples and you take 2, how many do you have?<P>6. if 2 men playing chess play 5 games and each man wins the same amount of games, and there are no ties, draws, and every game is completed, how did they do it?<P>7. if a truck driver stops to help a woman on the road who has a flat tire, and after helping the woman she offers $10, the truck driver refuses to take $10 from a sister, and the truckdriver is not the womans brother, what happened?<P>8. if 40 people are on a bus, and it costs $.25 per person to ride the bus, how much money did they pay?<P>9. several months have 30 and 31 days, but how many have 28?<P>10. if a man leaves home and makes 3 left turns, who are the 2 people in black masks at the end?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>1.  G.W. Bush, Clinton, G. Bush, J. Carter, Ronald Reagan, Jimmy Carter.<P>2.  The match.<P>3.  1 hour<P>4.  Cuz he's living.<P>5.  2<P>6.  They weren't playing each other.<P>7.  He helped a nun.<P>8.  $.25 each<P>9.  all of them.  Only Feb. has exactly 28. (sometimes 29)<P>10.  Carjackers?  This one stumped me.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><I><FONT COLOR="blue">The path of the righteous man is beset on all sides by the inequities of the selfish and the tyrranys of evil men. Blessed is he who in the name of charity and good will shepards the weak through the valley of darkness for he is truly his brothers keeper, and the finder of lost children. And I shall strike down upon thee with great vengence and furious anger, those who attempt to poison and destroy my brothers. And you will know my name is the lord when I lay my vengence upon thee. </I></FONT></FONT><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/9-11-01a.jpg"> ||||reg||1
